{"id":"cb6b888b6edaf01c","group":"29","path":"29/29-df-substitution.md","title":"替换 φ[t/x]","display":"df-substitution — 替换 φ[t/x]","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Descriptive Complexity (Neil Immerman)","book_abbrev":"29","label":"29-df-substitution","aliases":["29-df-substitution"],"display":"df-substitution — 替换 φ[t/x]","depends_on":["[[29-df-formula]]","[[29-df-term]]","[[29-df-variable]]","[[29-df-free-variable]]"],"source_locator":"Local syntactic reconstruction over §1.1, pp.5–11, DjVu scans 20–26","revision_basis":"本次仅据用户提供的29.zip修订；原source_locator及过去核对叙述为继承记录，未重新取得或查看DjVu原件","revision_verification":"数学接口审查及静态结构/链接检查；未提交证明助理内核证书"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Descriptive Complexity (Neil Immerman)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"29"},{"key":"label","html":"29-df-substitution"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>29-df-substitution</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-substitution — 替换 φ[t/x]"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3fa1d78e657e6a2\" href=\"?note=a3fa1d78e657e6a2\" title=\"29-df-formula\">29-df-formula</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"575d9a1532e3c73b\" href=\"?note=575d9a1532e3c73b\" title=\"29-df-term\">29-df-term</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"ad08b66c5e54a436\" href=\"?note=ad08b66c5e54a436\" title=\"29-df-variable\">29-df-variable</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"db2b32546860e623\" href=\"?note=db2b32546860e623\" title=\"29-df-free-variable\">29-df-free-variable</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_locator","html":"Local syntactic reconstruction over §1.1, pp.5–11, DjVu scans 20–26"},{"key":"revision_basis","html":"本次仅据用户提供的29.zip修订；原source_locator及过去核对叙述为继承记录，未重新取得或查看DjVu原件"},{"key":"revision_verification","html":"数学接口审查及静态结构/链接检查；未提交证明助理内核证书"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span> 为有限词汇，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S\">\\(\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t\\in\\mathrm{Term}_S\">\\(t\\in\\mathrm{Term}_S\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x,y\\in\\mathrm{Var}=\\{x_0,x_1,\\ldots\\}\">\\(x,y\\in\\mathrm{Var}=\\{x_0,x_1,\\ldots\\}\\)</span>；变量名的自然数编号固定。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf v(u)\">\\(\\mathsf v(u)\\)</span> 是项树中变量叶的集合；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{occ}(\\psi)\">\\(\\operatorname{occ}(\\psi)\\)</span> 由下式收集公式的全部变量名，包含绑定变量。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\circ\\in\\{\\land,\\lor,\\to,\\leftrightarrow\\}\">\\(\\circ\\in\\{\\land,\\lor,\\to,\\leftrightarrow\\}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q\\in\\{\\exists,\\forall\\}\">\\(Q\\in\\{\\exists,\\forall\\}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha\">\\(\\alpha\\)</span> 为原子公式；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\doteq\">\\(\\doteq\\)</span> 为对象语言的相等符号。递归在有限语法树上进行；出现冲突时用下式选择的最小未用变量作确定性改名。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Args}(u\\doteq v)\\coloneqq(u,v),\\qquad\\operatorname{Args}(R(u_1,\\ldots,u_a))\\coloneqq(u_1,\\ldots,u_a).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Args}(u\\doteq v)\\coloneqq(u,v),\\qquad\\operatorname{Args}(R(u_1,\\ldots,u_a))\\coloneqq(u_1,\\ldots,u_a).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf v(x_i)\\coloneqq\\{x_i\\},\\quad\\mathsf v(c)\\coloneqq\\varnothing,\\quad\\mathsf v(f(u_1,\\ldots,u_a))\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{j=1}^a\\mathsf v(u_j).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf v(x_i)\\coloneqq\\{x_i\\},\\quad\\mathsf v(c)\\coloneqq\\varnothing,\\quad\\mathsf v(f(u_1,\\ldots,u_a))\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{j=1}^a\\mathsf v(u_j).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{occ}(\\alpha)\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{u\\in\\operatorname{Args}(\\alpha)}\\mathsf v(u),\\quad\\operatorname{occ}(\\neg\\psi)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{occ}(\\psi),\\quad\\operatorname{occ}(\\psi\\circ\\chi)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{occ}(\\psi)\\cup\\operatorname{occ}(\\chi),\\quad\\operatorname{occ}(Qy\\,\\psi)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{occ}(\\psi)\\cup\\{y\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{occ}(\\alpha)\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{u\\in\\operatorname{Args}(\\alpha)}\\mathsf v(u),\\quad\\operatorname{occ}(\\neg\\psi)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{occ}(\\psi),\\quad\\operatorname{occ}(\\psi\\circ\\chi)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{occ}(\\psi)\\cup\\operatorname{occ}(\\chi),\\quad\\operatorname{occ}(Qy\\,\\psi)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{occ}(\\psi)\\cup\\{y\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{fresh}(\\psi,t,x,y)\\coloneqq x_{\\min\\{i\\in\\mathbb N\\mid x_i\\notin\\operatorname{occ}(\\psi)\\cup\\mathsf v(t)\\cup\\{x,y\\}\\}}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{fresh}(\\psi,t,x,y)\\coloneqq x_{\\min\\{i\\in\\mathbb N\\mid x_i\\notin\\operatorname{occ}(\\psi)\\cup\\mathsf v(t)\\cup\\{x,y\\}\\}}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{sub}_{x\\mapsto t}(x)\\coloneqq t,\\quad\\operatorname{sub}_{x\\mapsto t}(y)\\coloneqq y\\ (y\\ne x),\\quad\\operatorname{sub}_{x\\mapsto t}(c)\\coloneqq c,\\quad\\operatorname{sub}_{x\\mapsto t}(f(u_1,\\ldots,u_a))\\coloneqq f(\\operatorname{sub}_{x\\mapsto t}(u_1),\\ldots,\\operatorname{sub}_{x\\mapsto t}(u_a)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{sub}_{x\\mapsto t}(x)\\coloneqq t,\\quad\\operatorname{sub}_{x\\mapsto t}(y)\\coloneqq y\\ (y\\ne x),\\quad\\operatorname{sub}_{x\\mapsto t}(c)\\coloneqq c,\\quad\\operatorname{sub}_{x\\mapsto t}(f(u_1,\\ldots,u_a))\\coloneqq f(\\operatorname{sub}_{x\\mapsto t}(u_1),\\ldots,\\operatorname{sub}_{x\\mapsto t}(u_a)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\varphi[t/x]\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}\\operatorname{sub}_{x\\mapsto t}(u)\\doteq\\operatorname{sub}_{x\\mapsto t}(v),&amp;\\varphi=(u\\doteq v),\\\\R(\\operatorname{sub}_{x\\mapsto t}(u_1),\\ldots,\\operatorname{sub}_{x\\mapsto t}(u_a)),&amp;\\varphi=R(u_1,\\ldots,u_a),\\\\\\neg(\\psi[t/x]),&amp;\\varphi=\\neg\\psi,\\\\(\\psi[t/x])\\circ(\\chi[t/x]),&amp;\\varphi=\\psi\\circ\\chi,\\\\Qx\\,\\psi,&amp;\\varphi=Qx\\,\\psi,\\\\Qy\\,(\\psi[t/x]),&amp;\\varphi=Qy\\,\\psi,\\ y\\ne x,\\ y\\notin\\mathsf v(t),\\\\Qz\\,((\\psi[z/y])[t/x]),&amp;\\varphi=Qy\\,\\psi,\\ y\\ne x,\\ y\\in\\mathsf v(t),\\ z=\\operatorname{fresh}(\\psi,t,x,y).\\end{cases}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\varphi[t/x]\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}\\operatorname{sub}_{x\\mapsto t}(u)\\doteq\\operatorname{sub}_{x\\mapsto t}(v),&amp;\\varphi=(u\\doteq v),\\\\R(\\operatorname{sub}_{x\\mapsto t}(u_1),\\ldots,\\operatorname{sub}_{x\\mapsto t}(u_a)),&amp;\\varphi=R(u_1,\\ldots,u_a),\\\\\\neg(\\psi[t/x]),&amp;\\varphi=\\neg\\psi,\\\\(\\psi[t/x])\\circ(\\chi[t/x]),&amp;\\varphi=\\psi\\circ\\chi,\\\\Qx\\,\\psi,&amp;\\varphi=Qx\\,\\psi,\\\\Qy\\,(\\psi[t/x]),&amp;\\varphi=Qy\\,\\psi,\\ y\\ne x,\\ y\\notin\\mathsf v(t),\\\\Qz\\,((\\psi[z/y])[t/x]),&amp;\\varphi=Qy\\,\\psi,\\ y\\ne x,\\ y\\in\\mathsf v(t),\\ z=\\operatorname{fresh}(\\psi,t,x,y).\\end{cases}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Args}(\\top)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{Args}(\\bot)\\coloneqq\\langle\\rangle,\\qquad\\top[t/x]\\coloneqq\\top,\\qquad\\bot[t/x]\\coloneqq\\bot.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Args}(\\top)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{Args}(\\bot)\\coloneqq\\langle\\rangle,\\qquad\\top[t/x]\\coloneqq\\top,\\qquad\\bot[t/x]\\coloneqq\\bot.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>这是本书一阶语法所需的局部替换重构，原书并未逐行给出本条全部递归式。原子关系参数现在统一调用已定义的项替换，不再混用没有定义的项记号 u[t/x]。Args(α) 是原子语法节点的直接参数项序列。新鲜变量排除全部绑定与自由变量，并取最小编号，避免捕获且结果唯一。递归改名只作用于严格较小的量词体；变量改名不增加体的语法树大小，故复合递归仍良基。</p>\n<p>本次来源边界：以上原书定位与过往核对叙述继承自所给文件，不表示本次重新查看了原书或完成机器证明；本次修补以现有文本的类型、条件和依赖闭合为依据。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"29-df-formula","status":"resolved","id":"a3fa1d78e657e6a2","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-formula]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-term","status":"resolved","id":"575d9a1532e3c73b","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-term]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-variable","status":"resolved","id":"ad08b66c5e54a436","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-variable]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-free-variable","status":"resolved","id":"db2b32546860e623","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-free-variable]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"S","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S","display":false},{"tex":"t\\in\\mathrm{Term}_S","display":false},{"tex":"x,y\\in\\mathrm{Var}=\\{x_0,x_1,\\ldots\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf v(u)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{occ}(\\psi)","display":false},{"tex":"\\circ\\in\\{\\land,\\lor,\\to,\\leftrightarrow\\}","display":false},{"tex":"Q\\in\\{\\exists,\\forall\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\alpha","display":false},{"tex":"\\doteq","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Args}(u\\doteq v)\\coloneqq(u,v),\\qquad\\operatorname{Args}(R(u_1,\\ldots,u_a))\\coloneqq(u_1,\\ldots,u_a).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathsf v(x_i)\\coloneqq\\{x_i\\},\\quad\\mathsf v(c)\\coloneqq\\varnothing,\\quad\\mathsf v(f(u_1,\\ldots,u_a))\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{j=1}^a\\mathsf v(u_j).","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{occ}(\\alpha)\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{u\\in\\operatorname{Args}(\\alpha)}\\mathsf v(u),\\quad\\operatorname{occ}(\\neg\\psi)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{occ}(\\psi),\\quad\\operatorname{occ}(\\psi\\circ\\chi)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{occ}(\\psi)\\cup\\operatorname{occ}(\\chi),\\quad\\operatorname{occ}(Qy\\,\\psi)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{occ}(\\psi)\\cup\\{y\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{fresh}(\\psi,t,x,y)\\coloneqq x_{\\min\\{i\\in\\mathbb N\\mid x_i\\notin\\operatorname{occ}(\\psi)\\cup\\mathsf v(t)\\cup\\{x,y\\}\\}}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{sub}_{x\\mapsto t}(x)\\coloneqq t,\\quad\\operatorname{sub}_{x\\mapsto t}(y)\\coloneqq y\\ (y\\ne x),\\quad\\operatorname{sub}_{x\\mapsto t}(c)\\coloneqq c,\\quad\\operatorname{sub}_{x\\mapsto t}(f(u_1,\\ldots,u_a))\\coloneqq f(\\operatorname{sub}_{x\\mapsto t}(u_1),\\ldots,\\operatorname{sub}_{x\\mapsto t}(u_a)).","display":true},{"tex":"\\varphi[t/x]\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}\\operatorname{sub}_{x\\mapsto t}(u)\\doteq\\operatorname{sub}_{x\\mapsto t}(v),&\\varphi=(u\\doteq v),\\\\R(\\operatorname{sub}_{x\\mapsto t}(u_1),\\ldots,\\operatorname{sub}_{x\\mapsto t}(u_a)),&\\varphi=R(u_1,\\ldots,u_a),\\\\\\neg(\\psi[t/x]),&\\varphi=\\neg\\psi,\\\\(\\psi[t/x])\\circ(\\chi[t/x]),&\\varphi=\\psi\\circ\\chi,\\\\Qx\\,\\psi,&\\varphi=Qx\\,\\psi,\\\\Qy\\,(\\psi[t/x]),&\\varphi=Qy\\,\\psi,\\ y\\ne x,\\ y\\notin\\mathsf v(t),\\\\Qz\\,((\\psi[z/y])[t/x]),&\\varphi=Qy\\,\\psi,\\ y\\ne x,\\ y\\in\\mathsf v(t),\\ z=\\operatorname{fresh}(\\psi,t,x,y).\\end{cases}","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Args}(\\top)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{Args}(\\bot)\\coloneqq\\langle\\rangle,\\qquad\\top[t/x]\\coloneqq\\top,\\qquad\\bot[t/x]\\coloneqq\\bot.","display":true}],"bytes":3753,"backlinks":[{"id":"a0bddecd0c0bf21b","anchor":"ref-10","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{AtFml}_\\tau,\\mathrm{Fml}_\\tau,\\mathrm{Sent}_\\tau,\\mathrm{FV}_\\tau,\\mathrm{BV}_\\tau$ 取所列依赖。$\\mathrm{Var}=\\{x_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}$，索引单射取 [[29-df-variable]]；$x,y\\in\\mathrm{Var}$，$r,m\\in\\mathbb N$。$\\psi[t/x]$ 是 [[29-df-substitution]] 的捕获规避替换。"},{"id":"ecc0dd131d213345","anchor":"ref-137","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../29-df-substitution]]"}],"outgoing":["a3fa1d78e657e6a2","575d9a1532e3c73b","ad08b66c5e54a436","db2b32546860e623"]}